## 9. Comparison with Previous No-Camera Flight

![Previous flight comparison](/root/projects/ReplayAttack/iq_datasets/camera_flight_analysis/09_vs_prev_flight.png)

- The **previous no-camera flight** shows a clear power decrease from -60 to -72 dB as the drone flew away — a clean 12 dB drop
- Camera flights show **more noisy** power profiles — likely due to the camera's vibration motor and additional multipath effects
- Amplitude patterns are similar in shape but at lower levels for camera flights
- Phase drift patterns are comparable — movement detection works equally well with camera

